          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.598,
            0.863,
            0.617
          ],
          "content": "(1) 仪器、用具:显微镜、镊子、染色钵、刀片、载玻片、盖玻片、吸水纸等。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.62,
            0.579,
            0.639
          ],
          "content": "（2）材料:马铃薯块茎、洋葱根尖或洋葱鳞茎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.642,
            0.245,
            0.659
          ],
          "content": "(3) 试剂"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.664,
            0.304,
            0.681
          ],
          "content": "1）高碘酸溶液:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.215,
            0.685,
            0.433,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": "高碘酸（$\\mathrm{HIO_4 \\cdot 2H_2O}$）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.745,
            0.685,
            0.794,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": "0.4g"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.215,
            0.706,
            0.307,
            0.724
          ],
          "content": "95%乙醇"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.214,
            0.727,
            0.71,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": "1/3mol/L 乙酸钠溶液 (2.72g 乙酸钠溶于 100ml H₂O) 蒸馏水"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.746,
            0.75,
            0.796,
            0.767
          ],
          "content": "10 \\mathrm{ml}",
          "image_source": "images/page_4_equation_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.772,
            0.497,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": "2）席夫试剂（配法见Feulgen反应）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.794,
            0.537,
            0.812
          ],
          "content": "3）亚硫酸水溶液（配法见Feulgen反应）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.816,
            0.285,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": "4） $70\\%$ 乙醇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.836,
            0.897,
            0.876
          ],
          "content": "5）联苯胺溶液:在 $0.85\\%$ 盐水内加入联苯胺至饱和为止，临用前加入 $20\\%$ 体积的 $\\mathrm{H}_2\\mathrm{O}_2$ ，每 $2\\mathrm{ml}$ 加一滴。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.879,
            0.759,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": "6）0.1%钼酸铵溶液:称取0.1g钼酸铵溶于100ml 0.85%盐水中。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
